Seal Beads (a Seal Eggs mod) contains compiled code from Mutable Instruments Beads and stmlib
(https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack), heavily modified. That code is used under the MIT licence.
The Beads and stmlib source files carry copyright notices from 2012 to 2021 by Emilie Gillet; the licence text is:

